From u12f269733c6eb9a2 at groups.google.com  Wed Sep 30 16:11:43 2009
From: u12f269733c6eb9a2 at groups.google.com (Eric Rexstad)
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2009 16:11:43 +0000
Subject: Re: Estimating density per point?
Message-ID: <DIaCt2vfHbE.ghcSqbGXgtMJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
